    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a Master Alchemist who discovers the not-so-ancient technique of TRAINSMUTATION to expand, upgrade, and maintain a steam locomotive worthy of battling the apocalypse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444790/extras/300957609c39ce6c246c534996d7c8f6.poster.avif?t=1737708059\" width=578 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444790/extras/300957609c39ce6c246c534996d7c8f6.webm?t=1737708059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444790/extras/300957609c39ce6c246c534996d7c8f6.mp4?t=1737708059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Training</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No, not train. TRAIN! Fight, gather and craft Wagons, Components and Upgrades for your train to survive and fight back the quick-footed enemies that want to destroy you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444790/extras/4df15fcd42e2ee3d6d8c411913861260.poster.avif?t=1737708059\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444790/extras/4df15fcd42e2ee3d6d8c411913861260.webm?t=1737708059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444790/extras/4df15fcd42e2ee3d6d8c411913861260.mp4?t=1737708059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brewing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and discover fruits and roots to brew flasks which you... threw. Combine ingredients and discover deadly synergies or helpful concoctions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444790/extras/29957758b138f90969d79e6869c27c38.poster.avif?t=1737708059\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444790/extras/29957758b138f90969d79e6869c27c38.webm?t=1737708059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444790/extras/29957758b138f90969d79e6869c27c38.mp4?t=1737708059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlockables!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >characters, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weapons, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >wagons,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >trains,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >biomes,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >enemies,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and even bosses!</p></li></ul>",
